02:00040F49 BF
02:00040F4A 00
02:00040F4B D2
                            	  3971: 
                            	  3972: ; Player coordinate must be < these bounds.
                            	  3973: ; Using these bounds; the player will be considered within the
                            	  3974: ; bounds of a doorway, if strictly inside except for 1 or 2 pixels
                            	  3975: ; at the edge.
